Nicholas,

I have attached the request for the next piece of work in Japan. It sets out =
two areas for consideration: Finance payment controls and Sales order excepti=
ons. Please use it for your internal review today.

I would prefer you to propose first the area where the Japan records and resp=
onsible people can be brought together. Please distinguish what is already av=
ailable from what we still need to provide, and tell me what a first engageme=
nt could deliver and how we would judge it complete. We can leave an area out=
 if the evidence is not ready.

I would like to decide on 20 July. Please come back with the scope, duration =
and fee once you have worked through the dependencies; I have not set a budge=
t or duration in the request.

Best,
Kenneth

Kenneth Townsend
